WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.134
Throw it into the sea.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.096
Sheeta!

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:19.978
Hold onto that stone.
I'll trade her life for it.

00:00:48.965 --> 00:00:51.676
Get up! No more hide and seek.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:01.561
How delightful that it should end
in the throne room.

00:01:01.936 --> 00:01:02.812
Come here!

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.898
The throne room?

00:01:05.231 --> 00:01:07.317
This will be our grave.

00:01:08.985 --> 00:01:12.655
What is a king
when his country lies ruined?

00:01:13.031 --> 00:01:14.574
I won't give you the stone.

00:01:15.158 --> 00:01:18.369
You'll die, trapped here with me.
There's no escape.

00:01:19.496 --> 00:01:23.333
This is why Laputa died out.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.086
There's a song in my valley...

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:30.840
Put down your roots in the soil
Live together with the wind

00:01:30.924 --> 00:01:34.803
Pass the winter with the seeds
Sing in the spring with the birds

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:38.098
Your weapons may be powerful.

00:01:38.598 --> 00:01:41.226
Your pitiful robots may be numerous.

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:43.186
But you can't survive
away from the earth.

00:01:47.857 --> 00:01:47.941
Laputa will not die. It will rise again.

